<title>REPUBLIC OF IRELAND: New Irish car licensings rise to 14,131 in April.</title>
<headline>New Irish car licensings rise to 14,131 in April.</headline>
<dateline>DUBLIN 1997-07-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>The number of new private cars licensed in Ireland rose to 14,131 in April from 13,545 in March, provisional Central Statistics Office (CSO) data showed on Friday.</p>
<p>Licensings were down slightly on April 1996 when they totalled 14,280.</p>
<p>Dublin Newsroom +353 1 676 9779</p>
